name langnames
category Package
revision 64376
shortdesc Name languages and their genetic affiliations consistently
longdesc This package attempts to make the typing of language names,
longdesc codes, and families slightly easier by providing macros to
longdesc access pre-defined language--code--family combinations from two
longdesc important databases, as well as the possibility to create new
longdesc combinations. It may be particularly useful for large,
longdesc collaborative projects as well as typologically minded ones
longdesc with a variety of language examples.
